cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "Peptide passive-permeability benchmark on CycPeptMPDB"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark for predicted passive membrane permeability of cyclic
  peptides, scored per source paper against the curated PAMPA and Caco-2
  measurements of CycPeptMPDB. It reports the Pearson r of the prediction
  against the measured log P_app for 31 PAMPA sources and 10 Caco-2
  sources.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Receptor.AI, Inc."
    website: "https://receptor.ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/receptor-ai/peptide-benchmarks"
url: "https://github.com/receptor-ai/peptide-benchmarks"
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-07"
keywords:
  - peptides
  - cyclic peptides
  - membrane permeability
  - PAMPA
  - Caco-2
  - benchmark
